  "description": "\ud83d\udcd6 Scenario\r\n\r\nAn administrative map endpoint is protected by a simple request filter.\r\n\r\nThe application expects requests from a particular type of client. Unfortunately, the protection may rely on information supplied directly by the requester.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfaf Mission\r\n\r\nInvestigate:\r\n\r\nhttp://flag.cgcybercom.online/admin-map\r\n\r\nDetermine what request attribute controls access.\r\n\r\nSubmit only the required answer using the flag format: pcgCTF{answer}",
